# Isla Ceniza, south half (C7, contract 53), 36 x 14: the Mansion Calcinada's door (7,6) and the fire gym's (29,5), whose door has a LOCK on the only cell in front of it (29,6): a key door (`keydoor=llave_ceniza`, flag 858) opened by the
# Llave Ceniza found in the mansion; ash, lava rocks, steam vents, palms, two signs and an old man who tells where the key is. The gap (16..19,0) leads back to the north half.
@map isla_ceniza_sur
@size 36 14
@interior no
@area isla_ceniza
@bg 0
@fill ash
@flag gym_lock 858        # the gym's door was opened with the Llave Ceniza (hides the lock NPC for good)
@spawn north 17 1 S
@spawn mansion_door 7 7 S
@spawn gym_door 29 7 S
@legend
  .  tile=ash
  a  tile=ash object=lava_rock
  b  tile=ash object=gym_fuego
  c  tile=ash object=mansion_ruin
  d  tile=ash
  e  tile=ash object=palm_0
  f  tile=ash object=steam_vent
  g  tile=ash door=gym_fuego
  h  tile=ash door=mansion_ruin
  i  tile=ash object=sign interact=look text=ceniza.sign.gym
  j  tile=ash hide_flag=gym_lock keydoor=llave_ceniza
  k  tile=ash object=sign interact=look text=ceniza.sign.mansion
  l  tile=ash face=SW id=npc_c npc=anciano text=ceniza.npc.c
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaddddaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  a..................................a
  a.........e..............e.........a
  a...........a.........a............a
  a..a........................bbb....a
  a.....ccc...................bgb....a
  a.....chc.....a............i.j.....a
  a........k........f......l.......a.a
  a...e..............................a
  a..................................a
  a..................a...........f...a
  a..a.......a.............a.........a
  a...............e...............a..a
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
@warp d -> isla_ceniza spawn=south
@warp h -> mansion_calcinada_1 spawn=door
@warp g -> gimnasio_fuego spawn=door
